text scfoot0 "<footer class=\"aien-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-intro\"><a class=\"site-brand\" href=\"/classic/\">Sovereign Intelligence™</a><p>AienOS is the operating system inside Sovereign Intelligence. Everything here is open and stays inspectable. Made by Drake Stapleton.</p><p class=\"aien-reach-foot\"><a href=\"https://x.com/drakestapleton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">X @drakestapleton</a> <a href=\"mailto:drake@aienos.com\">drake@aienos.com</a> <a href=\"/aien/\">Speak to Aien</a> <a href=\"/forge/\">Radicle</a></p></div>"
